{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "id": "lpic1.104.7.fhs-search-recovery",
  "title_fr": "Classer et retrouver des fichiers selon le FHS",
  "brief_fr": "Dans /workspace/fhs, classe les quatre fichiers staging selon leur rôle : app.conf sous etc/lpic/, app.log sous var/log/lpic/, app.bin sous usr/local/bin/app et payload.dat sous srv/lpic/. Dans searchroot, construis locate.db alors que seul needle-old.txt existe, crée ensuite needle-new.txt, puis produis find-result.txt (les deux fichiers), locate-before.txt (seulement l'ancien avec la base non mise à jour), mets la base à jour et produis locate-after.txt (les deux). Produis aussi whereis.txt pour bash, puis type.txt et which.txt pour la commande tool fournie dans /workspace/bin après avoir placé ce répertoire en tête du PATH.",
  "success_criteria_fr": [
    "Les fichiers sont classés dans une arborescence FHS cohérente.",
    "find voit immédiatement le nouveau fichier alors que l'ancienne base locate ne le voit pas.",
    "updatedb rend ensuite le nouveau fichier visible à locate.",
    "whereis localise bash.",
    "type et which résolvent la commande ajoutée au PATH."
  ],
  "debrief_fr": "Le FHS associe des rôles aux répertoires. find parcourt l'état courant du filesystem ; locate interroge une base construite par updatedb et peut donc être obsolète. whereis cible binaire/source/man tandis que type/which suivent la résolution de commande du shell.",
  "objective_ids": [
    "104.7"
  ],
  "concept_ids": [
    "lpic1.104.7.role-des-principaux-repertoires-fhs",
    "lpic1.104.7.recherche-temps-reel-vs-base-locate",
    "lpic1.104.7.mise-a-jour-base-locate",
    "lpic1.104.7.localiser-binaire-source-man",
    "lpic1.104.7.resolution-de-commande-shell"
  ],
  "labels": [
    "lpic-required",
    "modern-practice"
  ],
  "estimated_minutes": 18,
  "practice_context": "fhs-search-recovery",
  "environment": {
    "backend": "podman",
    "image_ref": "localhost/lpic-daily/fedora-phase1:1",
    "distribution": "fedora",
    "network": "none",
    "capability_profile": "baseline",
    "writable_guest_paths": [
      "/workspace"
    ]
  },
  "resources": {
    "memory_mb": 256,
    "pids": 128,
    "timeout_seconds": 1200,
    "cpu_percent": 100
  },
  "setup": {
    "execution_scope": "sandbox",
    "script_ref": "setup.sh"
  },
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "command-exit",
      "argv": [
        "/usr/bin/bash",
        "-lc",
        "cmp -s /workspace/staging/app.conf /workspace/fhs/etc/lpic/app.conf && cmp -s /workspace/staging/app.log /workspace/fhs/var/log/lpic/app.log && cmp -s /workspace/staging/app.bin /workspace/fhs/usr/local/bin/app && cmp -s /workspace/staging/payload.dat /workspace/fhs/srv/lpic/payload.dat"
      ],
      "expected_exit": 0,
      "concept_ids": [
        "lpic1.104.7.role-des-principaux-repertoires-fhs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "file-content-regex",
      "path": "/workspace/find-result.txt",
      "pattern": "^needle-new\\.txt\\nneedle-old\\.txt\\n?$",
      "concept_ids": [
        "lpic1.104.7.recherche-temps-reel-vs-base-locate"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "file-content-regex",
      "path": "/workspace/locate-before.txt",
      "pattern": "^needle-old\\.txt\\n?$",
      "concept_ids": [
        "lpic1.104.7.recherche-temps-reel-vs-base-locate",
        "lpic1.104.7.mise-a-jour-base-locate"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "file-content-regex",
      "path": "/workspace/locate-after.txt",
      "pattern": "^needle-new\\.txt\\nneedle-old\\.txt\\n?$",
      "concept_ids": [
        "lpic1.104.7.mise-a-jour-base-locate"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command-exit",
      "argv": [
        "/usr/bin/bash",
        "-lc",
        "grep -q '/usr/bin/bash' /workspace/whereis.txt"
      ],
      "expected_exit": 0,
      "concept_ids": [
        "lpic1.104.7.localiser-binaire-source-man"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "file-content-regex",
      "path": "/workspace/type.txt",
      "pattern": "^file\\n?$",
      "concept_ids": [
        "lpic1.104.7.resolution-de-commande-shell"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "file-content-regex",
      "path": "/workspace/which.txt",
      "pattern": "^/workspace/bin/tool\\n?$",
      "concept_ids": [
        "lpic1.104.7.resolution-de-commande-shell"
      ]
    }
  ],
